  o Major bugfixes (security):
    - Do not purge memory for OOM from within low-level code.
      Previously,
      we would handle OOM conditions from within
      append_cell_to_circuit_queue, which could appear at various
      places within our call stack, and lead to objects being
      freed at surprising points in the code,
      with attendent risk of use-after-free errors.
      Now we only check for OOM conditions there, and handle
      them from much higher in the stack.
      Fixes bugs 41341, 41336, 41326, and 41363;
      bugfix on 0.2.4.14-alpha.
      Root-cause fix for TROVE-2026-043.
